Package: HelloFrog
Type: Package
Title: A Quirky ASCII-Art Frog Alternative to 'print'
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Linoy",
                  family = "Levi",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "linoyl@jfrog.com")
Description: Prints a user-supplied message alongside a small ASCII-art
    frog in one of several moods (default, sleepy, angry, party, ninja).
    Designed as a quirky alternative to 'print' for adding visual flair
    to console output in scripts, demos, teaching materials, and
    command-line tools.
